### Powering Your Off-Grid Vertical Garden

For installations without grid power, the system seamlessly integrates a **{{tm.solisCellTM}}** rechargeable battery block to power all tower functions.

For sustained operation, we recommend pairing it with **{{tm.hotCarrierTM}}** Solar Panels. A complimentary drone survey of your location will assess sunlight exposure to determine the optimal panel configuration for your needs, ensuring reliable power even in low-light conditions.

